<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for France.</title>
<headline>EU Commission 97/98 economic forecast for France.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for France -</p>
<p>				     1997	   1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.3	    3.0</p>
<p> Investment			4.4	    7.2</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.6	    1.7</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	   12.5	   12.1</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 3.0	    3.0</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 57.9	   58.9</p>
</text>
